00:20:30,659 --> 00:20:31,759
- Min Seo, I can see why you'd misunderstand.
- Yeah, we didn't do it.

256
00:20:31,759 --> 00:20:33,593
Wait! Why are you stopping her from talking?

257
00:20:33,593 --> 00:20:35,674
Min Seo, what did you see? Huh?

258
00:20:35,674 --> 00:20:36,926
What on earth did you do in front of her?

259
00:20:36,926 --> 00:20:38,546
