because you slept with him once?

296
00:22:27,482 --> 00:22:29,493
- What did you say?
- What, "this punk"? Huh?

297
00:22:29,493 --> 00:22:30,594
- Hey, you piece of work!
- Oh no.

298
00:22:30,594 --> 00:22:33,626
