- Are you okay?

301
00:22:40,670 --> 00:22:42,378
Sorry, sorry, are you okay?

302
00:22:42,378 --> 00:22:44,158
You punk. Where are you touching her?

303
00:22:44,158 --> 00:22:46,318
- Are you okay?
- This is ridiculous, seriously.

304
00:22:46,318 --> 00:22:48,106
I'll get some medicine.

305
00:22:48,106 --> 00:22:50,026
Are you alright?

306
00:22:51,550 --> 00:22:54,394
- Serves you right.
- Darn it.

307
00:22:54,394 --> 00:22:57,714
After always lecturing me like that.

308
00:22:57,714 --> 00:22:58,902
- And you did this
- Jeez.

309
00:22:58,902 --> 00:23:00,594
behind my back?

310
00:23:00,594 --> 00:23:02,559
It really serves you right!

311
00:23:02,559 --> 00:23:04,658
You fell for some two-bit entertainer
like him!

312
00:23:04,658 --> 00:23:06,382
And you even filmed crap like that.

313
00:23:06,382 --> 00:23:09,374
And all the while, you were always
acting so classy and sophisticated.

314
00:23:09,374 --> 00:23:11,190
Is this really all you amount to?

315
00:23:11,190 --> 00:23:13,682
