365
00:25:26,730 --> 00:25:31,026
Have you even done anything
for us in the first place?

366
00:25:31,026 --> 00:25:34,450
I... I've never done anything for you?

367
00:25:34,450 --> 00:25:36,614
How can you say I never did anything for you?

368
00:25:36,614 --> 00:25:39,366
