377
00:25:57,554 --> 00:26:00,559
Did you ever worry about me even once?

378
00:26:01,626 --> 00:26:03,470
And that accident this time,

379
00:26:03,470 --> 00:26:07,382
I was the one who handled
the whole mess, wasn't I?

380
00:26:07,382 --> 00:26:11,559
I was terrified too, but I still had to
deal with that heavy man...

381
00:26:12,778 --> 00:26:15,210
Darn it! Seriously!

382
00:26:15,210 --> 00:26:17,298
Crap!

383
00:26:17,298 --> 00:26:19,059
Ugh, darn it!

384
00:26:19,059 --> 00:26:20,126
Darn it!

385
00:26:20,126 --> 00:26:22,294
Ugh, jeez!

386
00:26:22,294 --> 00:26:24,126
Darn it!

387
00:26:27,146 --> 00:26:29,590
Why did I put up with all this for so long?

388
00:26:29,590 --> 00:26:31,046
Darn it!

389
00:26:31,046 --> 00:26:33,158
Darn it, seriously!

390
00:26:33,158 --> 00:26:35,738
Why? Why?

391
00:26:35,738 --> 00:26:37,714
Why... Why did you do this? Why?

392
00:26:37,714 --> 00:26:41,558
