398
00:27:02,178 --> 00:27:05,538
How could you hurt me like this? How?

399
00:27:05,538 --> 00:27:09,526
How could you hurt me this badly?

400
00:27:13,362 --> 00:27:17,050
Forget it. I'm done with it all.

401
