00:32:16,106 --> 00:32:18,742
He should've had his law license
revoked a long time ago.

505
00:32:18,742 --> 00:32:20,170
Let's report him to the police
this time and...

506
00:32:20,170 --> 00:32:22,226
Wait, I don't think we should just
call the police without thinking.

507
00:32:22,226 --> 00:32:23,886
Oh, call them. Just call them.
Call them. Go ahead.

508
00:32:23,886 --> 00:32:26,030
Call the police, just call them.

509
00:32:26,030 --> 00:32:30,078
I'll report the murder-for-hire you arranged
and the two hit-and-runs first.

510
00:32:30,078 --> 00:32:31,826
- We should report those first.
- Hit-and-run?

511
00:32:31,826 --> 00:32:35,014
You came for the video,
and now what are you talking about?

512
00:32:35,014 --> 00:32:38,842
No, no. I mean, this is all some kind of...

513
00:32:38,842 --> 00:32:41,893
- misunderstanding!
- What misunderstanding?

514
00:32:41,893 --> 00:32:44,950
That private investigator
she hired to kill me.

515
00:32:44,950 --> 00:32:47,526
- What?
- You two hit him and ran!

516
00:32:47,526 --> 00:32:49,130
- You tried to kill him?
- I saw it.

517
00:32:49,130 --> 00:32:51,226
Wait, wait...

518
00:32:53,126 --> 00:32:55,438
- A private investigator?
- Wait, you...

519
00:32:55,438 --> 00:32:57,241
You hired a private investigator
to kill Mr. Choi?

520
00:32:57,241 --> 00:33:00,875
No, no, that's not it.
I said I was only going to talk to him.

521
00:33:00,875 --> 00:33:03,526
What a load of crap. Hey, hey, hey!

522
00:33:03,526 --> 00:33:07,102
What kind of talk involves kidnapping
and threatening to kill someone? Darn it.

523
00:33:07,102 --> 00:33:08,478
It's a good thing he got hit by a car!

524
00:33:08,478 --> 00:33:11,126
- That venomous snake...
- Wait!

525
00:33:14,810 --> 00:33:16,511
So that means...

526
00:33:17,162 --> 00:33:20,846
that man was there that day...

527
00:33:20,846 --> 00:33:22,418
- That man?
- Yes, he was there.

528
00:33:22,418 --> 00:33:25,326
So the accident that happened that night...

529
00:33:25,326 --> 00:33:27,026
The accident?

530
00:33:28,238 --> 00:33:31,693
And you've been hiding,
acting like it was nothing?

531
00:33:31,693 --> 00:33:33,301
Leaving us to clean up your mess?

532
00:33:33,301 --> 00:33:35,246
No. Who could've known
it would turn out like this?

533
00:33:35,246 --> 00:33:37,742
Wait, I didn't even want to hire him.

534
00:33:37,742 --> 00:33:40,159
Your husband was the one who introduced me

535
00:33:40,159 --> 00:33:42,064
and pushed me to hire
the PI in the first place!

536
00:33:42,064 --> 00:33:43,970
- Hey, Ahn Soo Jung!
- What? Lim Jae Hong!

537
00:33:43,970 --> 00:33:45,714
Both of you, just shut up!

538
00:33:45,714 --> 00:33:47,402
Jeez, shut up, shut up, shut up!

539
00:33:47,402 --> 00:33:49,430
Everyone shut up and stay put.

540
00:33:49,430 --> 00:33:50,798
Okay, that's enough.

541
00:33:50,798 --> 00:33:53,630
Ms. Park Kyung Hee, listen carefully. Okay?

542
00:33:53,630 --> 00:33:55,602
If you just hand over that phone,

543
00:33:55,602 --> 00:33:58,442
I'll overlook the hit-and-run,
the murder-for-hire,

544
00:33:58,442 --> 00:34:01,238
all of it, okay?

545
00:34:01,238 --> 00:34:02,938
Give it to me.

546
00:34:04,042 --> 00:34:06,222
Huh?

547
00:34:06,222 --> 00:34:08,198
Hey, actor boy!

548
00:34:08,198 --> 00:34:10,518
You want to go to prison with your wife?

549
00:34:10,518 --> 00:34:11,993
All you have to do is give me the phone!

550
00:34:11,993 --> 00:34:13,293
- What did you just call me?
- You punk...

551
00:34:13,293 --> 00:34:15,318
Wait, stop!

552
00:34:15,318 --> 00:34:18,238
Okay, let's get this straight.

553
00:34:18,238 --> 00:34:22,334
Ahn Soo Jung, you hired a PI
to kill Mr. Choi,

554
00:34:22,334 --> 00:34:23,993
and you, Ms. Park,
hit him with her car and killed him.

555
00:34:23,993 --> 00:34:25,698
Am I understanding this correctly? Huh?

556
00:34:25,698 --> 00:34:28,654
We weren't trying to kill him!

557
00:34:28,654 --> 00:34:34,493
Did you actually see us hit him?

558
00:34:36,166 --> 00:34:38,010
What?

559
00:34:38,010 --> 00:34:40,814
You think I'm bluffing? Huh?

560
00:34:40,814 --> 00:34:45,698
I saw the two of you hit that guy, freak out,

561
00:34:45,698 --> 00:34:48,762
and then take off running. I saw it all.

562
00:34:48,762 --> 00:34:51,302
So don't even think about denying it. Okay?

563
00:34:51,302 --> 00:34:53,002
Hand that over, now.

564
00:34:54,870 --> 00:34:57,526
If I just hand over the phone...

565
00:34:59,466 --> 00:35:01,459
you'll keep your mouth shut, right?

566
00:35:03,838 --> 00:35:07,502
I guess we can't even
go to a sauna after 10 p.m.

567
00:35:07,502 --> 00:35:10,918
Why are they so strict only with minors?

568
00:35:10,918 --> 00:35:12,898
I know.

569
00:35:12,898 --> 00:35:15,238
They should make adults
bring a consent form from their kids too.

570
00:35:15,238 --> 00:35:17,493
To put an end to affairs, you know.

571
00:35:20,039 --> 00:35:25,123
They're the ones having affairs,
but do you know what they used to say to me?

572
00:35:25,123 --> 00:35:29,518
They said I was too young to know
whether what I felt was really love.

573
00:35:29,518 --> 00:35:32,326
They said you were going to betray me.

574
00:35:32,326 --> 00:35:35,198
They acted all friendly and cool.
Seriously...

575
00:35:35,198 --> 00:35:36,993
Isn't that ridiculous?

576
00:35:44,310 --> 00:35:46,010
Can you...

577
00:35:47,044 --> 00:35:50,426
stand to look at your parents again?

578
00:36:02,138 --> 00:36:03,838
Then what about us?

579
00:36:05,430 --> 00:36:08,193
Are things okay between us?

580
00:37:10,082 --> 00:37:13,598
We'll check into it properly,
so please go back inside, okay?

581
00:37:13,598 --> 00:37:16,694
No, I'm not asking you to check.
I'm asking you to stop them.

582
00:37:16,694 --> 00:37:19,082
- Please stop them.
- But it's quiet now.

583
00:37:19,082 --> 00:37:21,810
Of course, it's quiet now!

584
00:37:21,810 --> 00:37:23,542
That's why you need to hurry over.

585
00:37:23,542 --> 00:37:26,074
Just a moment ago,
they were fighting like crazy.

586
00:37:26,074 --> 00:37:27,893
Understood.

587
00:37:36,159 --> 00:37:37,666
We'll reach out to you. Please stay inside.

588
00:37:37,666 --> 00:37:39,238
- Please text me.
- Okay.

589
00:37:39,238 --> 00:37:40,887
How am I...

590
00:37:41,657 --> 00:37:43,759
supposed to trust you?

591
00:37:46,559 --> 00:37:50,958
Well, if you don't trust me,
you're going to jail.

592
00:37:50,958 --> 00:37:52,717
No way.

593
00:37:52,717 --> 00:37:54,994
I can't just let this slide!

594
00:37:54,994 --> 00:37:56,474
If I let this go,

595
00:37:56,474 --> 00:37:58,102
I'll become an accomplice
to both the murder-for-hire

596
00:37:58,102 --> 00:37:59,654
and the hit-and-run, right?

597
00:37:59,654 --> 00:38:01,959
Joo Bo Sung, you seriously!

598
00:38:03,222 --> 00:38:06,462
<i>This is the police.
We'd like to ask for your cooperation.</i>

599
00:38:06,462 --> 00:38:08,878
- Police? Why are the police...
- What? Why are the police here?

600
00:38:08,878 --> 00:38:11,326
Oh, good. I'll report this now, and...

601
00:38:11,326 --> 00:38:13,226
- Hold on.
- Oh, come on.

602
00:38:13,226 --> 00:38:15,159
Wait, wait, Dr. Joo, why don't we
talk this over a little more?

603
00:38:15,159 --> 00:38:17,460
- All I need is the phone, so...
- I'll give you the phone.

604
00:38:17,460 --> 00:38:18,659
- Just a second...
- What are you talking about? Huh?

605
00:38:18,659 --> 00:38:20,862
So you're just going to let Ahn Soo Jung

606
00:38:20,862 --> 00:38:22,946
get away with hiring someone to kill you?

607
00:38:22,946 --> 00:38:24,193
Jeez, get a grip!
You're not going to win the trial?

608
00:38:24,193 --> 00:38:26,293
- Jeez, I said stay still!
- Quiet, quiet!

609
00:38:26,293 --> 00:38:29,126
There's a lot you don't know
about what's going on!

610
00:38:37,078 --> 00:38:38,690
- No, don't grab me.
- I said no!

611
00:38:38,690 --> 00:38:41,126
Let go of me! Let go, you criminal!

612
00:38:54,726 --> 00:38:56,226
Oh my, oh my!

613
00:38:56,226 --> 00:38:58,882
- Mr. Choi!
- What happened?

614
00:38:58,882 --> 00:39:01,230
Mr. Choi...

615
00:39:02,150 --> 00:39:03,850
Are you alright?

616
00:39:03,850 --> 00:39:06,626
Hey... are you okay?

617
00:39:06,626 --> 00:39:07,718
Oh, no.

618
00:39:10,202 --> 00:39:11,559
- Give me the phone.
- Well...

619
00:39:11,559 --> 00:39:13,394
- Where is the phone?
- The phone...

620
00:39:13,394 --> 00:39:15,106
Where is the phone?

621
00:39:15,106 --> 00:39:17,198
The phone...

622
00:39:17,198 --> 00:39:18,722
- Give me my phone.
- Wait.

623
00:39:18,722 --> 00:39:20,594
- No...
- Oh my god!

624
00:39:20,594 --> 00:39:21,998
What is wrong?

625
00:39:21,998 --> 00:39:24,718
- What...
- Mr. Choi, Mr. Choi!

626
00:39:24,718 --> 00:39:26,566
What is wrong with him?

627
00:39:26,566 --> 00:39:28,566
What should we do?

628
00:39:29,554 --> 00:39:31,293
Mr. Choi, are you alright?

629
00:39:34,878 --> 00:39:37,566
Your vacation house is really nice.

630
00:39:37,566 --> 00:39:39,570
The view is really nice.

631
00:39:39,570 --> 00:39:41,318
Right?

632
00:39:41,318 --> 00:39:44,338
But this whole area isn't ours.

633
00:39:44,338 --> 00:39:47,759
I'm pretty sure
our house is mostly financed too.

634
00:39:49,854 --> 00:39:54,022
Hey, why does that part stick out?

635
00:39:54,022 --> 00:39:55,882
What?

636
00:39:55,882 --> 00:40:00,418
You're right. It wasn't like this before.

637
00:40:00,418 --> 00:40:02,162
What's this?

638
00:40:02,162 --> 00:40:03,862
This is weird.

639
00:40:06,214 --> 00:40:08,078
Do you smell something?

640
00:40:08,078 --> 00:40:10,158
Smell what?

641
00:40:10,158 --> 00:40:12,830
Oh yeah.
There wasn't this kind of smell before.

642
00:40:12,830 --> 00:40:15,754
- Maybe a rat died somewhere?
- Right?

643
00:40:15,754 --> 00:40:18,393
It smells like something's rotting.

644
00:40:31,962 --> 00:40:34,574
Sit down. Want something to drink?

645
00:40:34,574 --> 00:40:37,274
Huh? Yeah. Sure.

646
00:41:57,050 --> 00:41:58,793
Wanna grab a beer?

647
00:42:05,090 --> 00:42:09,926
Ye Ji, you know, that night of the accident.

648
00:42:09,926 --> 00:42:13,822
The adults said they took care of everything,

649
00:42:13,822 --> 00:42:18,506
but do you know what they did
with the man who died?

650
00:42:18,506 --> 00:42:20,206
Well...

651
00:42:28,054 --> 00:42:30,259
We've met before, right?

652
00:42:36,858 --> 00:42:38,486
I'm not really sure...

653
00:42:38,486 --> 00:42:41,094
Oh, come on.
You know, at the demolition site.

654
00:42:41,094 --> 00:42:43,026
Did you find the cat?

655
00:42:47,202 --> 00:42:49,170
What brings you here?

656
00:42:49,170 --> 00:42:52,626
Well, I just had something
to take care of nearby.

657
00:42:55,846 --> 00:42:59,014
This is our vacation home, so how did you...

658
00:42:59,014 --> 00:43:01,822
Yeah, I know.

659
00:43:01,822 --> 00:43:04,086
I'll be leaving soon.

660
00:43:04,086 --> 00:43:07,093
I didn't mean to overhear...

661
00:43:08,650 --> 00:43:10,693
but did you say someone died?

